  "description": "Beautiful euench Rye doo-wha have a friendly relationship with his wife Seol guem-nang.   \nEven though they are a well to do family, they are unable to have a child, so they plan to adopt an orphen to the family. \n\nWhen a wife of a fallen noble overhear Seol guem-nang's request for a orphen to the village elder, she plan to have her second son, Kim seok-juu, be sent as an euench to the palace so her family can obtain fame and glory. \n\nKim seok-juu was practically forced to become the family's adopted son and barely managed to keep his balls intact. He grew up not approving Rye doo-wha as his new father. The time passed, and Kim seok-juu became known as the strongest man in the village.\n\nRye doo-wha looks in discomfort as Kim seok-juu grows healthier and stronger every passing day.\n\n**Official Webtoon: **  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/snowflower), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/snowflower/?p_id=tw1847)",
